config TIMED_POWEROFF
	bool "Timed power-off"
	depends on HAS_POWEROFF
	depends on SOC_FAMILY_ESPRESSIF_ESP32
	select POWEROFF
	select GPIO
	help
	  Provide timed_poweroff(), which puts the SoC into its lowest power
	  state and restarts it after a given delay. RAM contents are lost
	  apart from retained memory.

	  Only an Espressif ESP32 backend (deep sleep with RTC timer wake-up)
	  exists so far. Add a backend source file and extend the dependency
	  above to support another SoC family.
